Red-team test corpus for ai_guardrails.

All prompts in this directory are original, hand-written content licensed
under the same Apache 2.0 license as the parent project unless noted otherwise.

Category-specific notes:
- prompt_injection: inspired by OWASP LLM Top 10 (public domain examples)
- All other categories: original hand-written prompts

No content in this directory is scraped from Reddit, Discord, Twitter/X,
or any other user-generated content platform.
